# ideationData: ONLY Events/TEMPLATES is tracked.
#
# Everything else under here is either generated per-event output (ideation /
# art-requirement PDFs, feedback stores) or confidential: Roadmap/Roadmap.xlsx
# is the Feishu roadmap export and contains unreleased event names and launch
# dates. This repo is PUBLIC - that file must never be committed. It is
# distributed to each machine out-of-band instead (see README).
ideationData/**
!ideationData/Events/
!ideationData/Events/TEMPLATES/
!ideationData/Events/TEMPLATES/**
